## Company Information

- **Company Name:** {{ company }}
- **Founded:** {{ founded }}
- **Headquarters:** {{ headquarters.city }}, {{ headquarters.state }} {{ headquarters.zipCode }}, {{ headquarters.country }}
- **Total Employees:** {{ employees.size }}

