## Employee Directory

{{ for employee in employees }}
### {{ employee.name }} (ID: {{ employee.id }})

- **Department:** {{ employee.department }}
- **Position:** {{ employee.position }}
- **Salary:** ${{ employee.salary }}
- **Skills:** {{ employee.skills | array.join ", " }}

