## Salary Statistics

{{ total_salary = 0 }}
{{ high_earner_count = 0 }}
{{ for emp in employees }}
  {{ total_salary = total_salary + emp.salary }}
  {{ if emp.salary >= 90000 }}
    {{ high_earner_count = high_earner_count + 1 }}
  {{ end }}
{{ end }}

- **Total Payroll:** ${{ total_salary }}
- **Average Salary:** ${{ (total_salary / employees.size) | math.round }}
- **Employees Earning $90K+:** {{ high_earner_count }}

{{ if high_earner_count > 0 }}
### High Earners ($90,000+)
{{ for emp in employees }}
{{ if emp.salary >= 90000 }}
- {{ emp.name }} - {{ emp.position }}: ${{ emp.salary }}
{{ end }}
{{ end }}
{{ end }}

---

## Skills Inventory

{{ all_skills = [] }}
{{ for emp in employees }}
  {{ for skill in emp.skills }}
    {{ skill_found = false }}
    {{ for existing in all_skills }}
      {{ if existing == skill }}
        {{ skill_found = true }}
      {{ end }}
    {{ end }}
    {{ if !skill_found }}
      {{ all_skills = all_skills | array.add skill }}
    {{ end }}
  {{ end }}
{{ end }}

**Total Unique Skills:** {{ all_skills.size }}

{{ for skill in all_skills | array.sort }}
- **{{ skill }}**
{{ end }}

